WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.230
This is a shop front built in Presslane.

2
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.910
Standard print and stitch is one of our example shops.

3
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:14.510
Products sit under their own categories and brands and customers buy straight from the page.

4
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.310
Here is the back office that built it.

5
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:21.569
Start from a template. If you want one built to your own design,

6
00:00:21.569 --> 00:00:23.670
speak to our team and we will make it.

7
00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.310
Everything else you change yourself.

8
00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.732
Move a section up or down the page.

9
00:00:28.732 --> 00:00:32.090
Open it and set the heading the words and where they sit.

10
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:35.190
The menu and the footer work the same way.

11
00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:37.150
So do the colours.

12
00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:41.270
Check it on a tablet and on a phone before anyone else sees it.

13
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.030
Then publish it.

14
00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.310
That is the whole shop front.

15
00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.150
Runs the shop while you print.

